  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">야외수업하려니 어려움이 있네요^^<br>어떤 암석인지 확실히 모르겠어서 질문드립니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c9419fb68b2fa611614b4d74a4c7be461201a4b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c9419fb68b2fa611614b4d74a4c7be461201a4b\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"699\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. 이건 현무암인가요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b57a4001049a60d4de7c7416c64c3956ed4c916c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b57a4001049a60d4de7c7416c64c3956ed4c916c\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"346\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 무슨암석인지 모르겠습니다ㅠㅠ사암같기도 하구요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97829f45d7676701118cd7c8e70d49fda3839514\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97829f45d7676701118cd7c8e70d49fda3839514\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"476\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 화강암이 맞을까요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18fe07da4557128665874f288e69efd313e18b5f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18fe07da4557128665874f288e69efd313e18b5f\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"242\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">4,5는 편마암 같긴한데 확실히는 모르겠습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e2b302e3d6a92cc54fa2cbda3b5d998983d4303\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e2b302e3d6a92cc54fa2cbda3b5d998983d4303\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"402\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">6. 편마암인가요? 7.은 무엇일까요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/58634d8098c9591f966194311ade6137620bd49d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/58634d8098c9591f966194311ade6137620bd49d\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"248\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">8. 이것도 무슨 암석인지 모르겠습니다.<br><br>쓰고나니 질문이 많네요^^<br>선생님들의 도움이 필요합니다.<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}